  "note": [
    "The Library's fabric, cut from the one Lawanda layout in scripts/fabric-lawanda.mjs -- regenerate from there, do not hand-edit. LIBRARY v2: 12 x 4 x 12, the eye at the middle, its floor 0.6 m above the Library Lobby's. A large carpeted room, warm and subdued: the desk in the south-east quarter by the south wall, side-on to the mouth, the microfilm reader (SPOOL-READER) on its west half with its screen facing north -- dark while the reader is without ONBIT, lit while it has it; twelve small tables either side of a clear aisle up the axis and two more in the north-east quarter. No books, no shelves, no chairs.",
